  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.67 “National emergency medical services information system (NEMSIS)” means the national EMS electronic database, as developed and published by USDOT, NHTSA.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
